/// `@` (checked via the `trunk() & ::@` revset), so measuring "behind" against it would report a
/// meaningless count and rebasing onto it would either be wrong or hit `immutableHistory`. Raised
/// BEFORE attempting the rebase, not just caught after — the whole point being to stop guessing at
